[32m+[m[32m------------------------------[m
[32m+[m[32mDo NOT say that every client request is independently sent to all 3 nodes.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCorrect flow:[m
[32m+[m[32mClient -> Leader -> Leader log -> Follower replication -> Majority ACK[m
[32m+[m[32m-> Commit -> State-machine application.[m
