[32m+[m[32m- Leader normally receives client traffic.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Followers should show replication / AppendEntries / ACK / state-machine activity.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Follower client-request metrics do not need to equal leader metrics.[m
[32m+[m[32m- A 3-node Raft cluster remains available after losing one node because[m
[32m+[m[32m  2/3 nodes still form a majority.[m
